/* SF32LB58 a128r32n1 memory layout:
 *
 *   Flash (XIP):  QSPI2 NOR 1 MB at 0x12000000 (bootloader @ 0x12000000, app @ 0x12010000)
 *   SRAM:         RAM0-RAM5 = 2 MB (0x20000000)
 *   Retention:    64 KB (0x00020000, survives deep sleep)
 *   PSRAM:        MPI1 OPSRAM = 16 MB (0x60400000)
 *   PSRAM2:       MPI2 qPSRAM = 16 MB (0x62000000)
 *
 * Section ordering in ROM:
 *   1. .text (vector table MUST be at flash base)
 *   2. .retm_data (loaded from flash, copied to retention RAM at boot)
 *   3. .copy.table, .zero.table
 *   4. .data, .ramfunc (loaded from flash, copied to SRAM at boot)
 */

